(7632219, 1237325, 173844, '<td valign="top">The wondrous bright sky imbues the pool setting with a sense of isolation, a world unto itself.  The uniformly older men suggest a club atmosphere, a relict and secret population.  Okay, letting imagination run away a bit on this, but so it seems.  Water and its endless swirling, always entrancing.  The forward man, about to push off into a dive, is a powerful focal point, the about-to-be explosion of energy that we''ll never see but will anticipate forever.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'The wondrous bright sky imbues the pool setting with a sense of isolation, a world unto itself.  The uniformly older men suggest a club atmosphere, a relict and secret population.  Okay, letting imagination run away a bit on this, but so it seems.  Water and its endless swirling, always entrancing.  The forward man, about to push off into a dive, is a powerful focal point, the about-to-be explosion of energy that we''ll never see but will anticipate forever.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2019-06-08 09:19:20.000000', NULL, 0),
